  "summary": "Removes trailing newline escape sequences from single-line log calls across the codebase using a scripted diff, excluding several high-churn files to minimize merge conflicts. It also removes embedded newlines from CTransaction::ToString, converting the transaction stringification used in debug logs into a single line.",
